{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20202","headline":"吊元鲁山 一 · 孟郊","name":"吊元鲁山 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"[搏]鸷有余饱，鲁山长饥空。\n豪人饫鲜肥，鲁山饭蒿蓬。\n食名皆霸官，食力乃尧农。\n君子耻新态，鲁山与古终。\n天璞本平一，人巧生异同。\n鲁山不自剖，全璞竟没躬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20202.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20202","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}